{
  "_comment": [
    "Synthetic gen1 Yellow scenario: a new game, one wild battle, one BROCK battle and a reset.",
    "It is built to touch every gen1 state-machine hook in components/frontend.js:",
    "  player.playerId 0 -> N        new run (attempts++, timer start)",
    "  meta.state To Battle/Battle/From Battle/Overworld with battle.type Trainer",
    "                                OBS 'IN - BROCK' and 'OUT - <class>' chapter markers",
    "  battle.type change            useBattleStore.startBattle",
    "  battle.lowHealthAlarm Disabled + battle.type Trainer",
    "                                endBattle, Full/Deprecated/Simple split CSVs, right-panel override",
    "  player.playerId N -> 0        reset (resets++)",
    "Every path is checked against the mapper XML at build time, so a typo fails the build",
    "instead of silently doing nothing. Values are plausible, not a real run: this fixture",
    "proves determinism and no-change-under-refactor, never correctness (see make-fixture.ts)."
  ],
